  "foaf:name": "EuroMarine Association (European Marine Research Network)",
  "sdo:name": "EuroMarine Association (European Marine Research Network)",
  "sdo:description": "EuroMarine Association is a pan-European marine science network that brings together research-performing organisations across all European sea basins. As a proposed Decade Implementing Partner, it would serve primarily as a bottom-up, member-driven platform supporting cross-basin exchange, co-design, networking, training, and foresight rather than basin-specific implementation. Thematically, EuroMarine is strongly positioned at the interface of biodiversity and ecosystem restoration, ocean-climate interactions, ocean observation and data mobilisation, capacity development, and science–society engagement. Through its funding schemes, working groups, schools, and early-career programmes, it translates broad scientific and policy priorities into collaborative research agendas and communities of practice.",
